<title>COTE D'IVOIRE: Sierra Leone peace accord signed in Ivory Coast.</title>
<headline>Sierra Leone peace accord signed in Ivory Coast.</headline>
<dateline>ABIDJAN 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sierra Leone government and rebels signed a comprehensive peace accord at a public ceremony in Ivory Coast on Saturday to end nearly six years of civil war.</p>
</text>
